{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301030","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230103001:1":{"text":"그런가? 크흠, 내 말은, 나도 그렇게 생각한다는 거지.","source_cn":"是这样嘛？咳！我是说，我也这样认为。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89B774047588BC98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230103002:1":{"text":"《신들의 폭포》라는 노래는 모두가 부를 수 있는 노래라네. 나는 해변가에서 부르는 걸 좋아하지!","source_cn":"这首《神之瀑》我们这人人都会唱，我更喜欢在海边唱起它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x470D68D2468D1E52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230103003:1":{"text":"하지만 그동안 바다에 안개가 자욱하게 끼어 있어서, 내 배도 반년 동안이나 출항하지 못했어.","source_cn":"不过这段时间海上一直大雾弥漫，我的渔船也已经半年没出航。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85F6F91D6DAF2B81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230103004:1":{"text":"휴... 노래를 부르며 톱니장어와 싸우던 나날이 그립군.","source_cn":"唉……真怀念一边唱歌一边和巨齿海鳗搏斗的日子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D1A442013E374AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:老渔夫罗塞尔":{"text":"나이 든 어부 로젤라","source":"老渔夫罗塞尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}